The program carries the migration firmware packages (mg2esphome-<Model>.zip)
as data and hands them to the devices. The migration firmware is a separate
program, licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 (see
LICENSE-migration-firmware, inherited from mgos-to-tasmota). Its complete
